, isome kwa mwenzako na ubaini sehemu zinazohitaji kufafanuliwa.","Wasilisha toleo lililoboreshwa ukizingatia lengo, hadhira na kanuni za uandishi."],"resources":"Vichocheo vya uandishi, daftari, kielelezo asilia na orodha ya ukaguzi.","assessment":"Rubriki ya muundo, ubunifu, usahihi wa lugha na uhariri.","competencies":"Mawasiliano na ushirikiano, ubunifu, kufikiri kwa kina na kujiamini."},{"id":"3.4.1","themeId":3,"theme":"Mahusiano","strand":"Sarufi","title":"Viwakilishi vya Nafsi","persistedTitle":"Mahusiano — Viwakilishi vya Nafsi","sourceLessons":2,"supportLessons":0,"lessons":2,"outcomes":["Kutambua matumizi ya viwakilishi vya nafsi katika sentensi zinazohusiana na mahusiano.","Kutunga sentensi sahihi kwa kuzingatia kanuni za viwakilishi vya nafsi na upatanisho wa kisarufi.","Kurekebisha makosa ya matumizi ya viwakilishi vya nafsi na kueleza sababu ya marekebisho."],"inquiry":["Je, viwakilishi vya nafsi husaidiaje kuleta maana sahihi katika sentensi?"],"experiences":["Chunguza sentensi halisi zilizotungwa darasani kuhusu mahusiano na utambue viwakilishi vya nafsi.","Unda mifano miwili sahihi na linganisha tofauti yake na sentensi yenye kosa.","Sahihisha sentensi na ueleze kanuni ya sarufi iliyotumika."],"resources":"Kadi za sentensi, daftari, mifano asilia na kamusi.","assessment":"Utambuzi wa kanuni, mifano sahihi na usahihishaji wa sentensi.","competencies":"Mawasiliano na ushirikiano, ubunifu, kufikiri kwa kina na kujiamini."},{"id":"3.4.2","themeId":3,"theme":"Mahusiano","strand":"Sarufi","title":"Viwakilishi Viashiria","persistedTitle":"Mahusiano — Viwakilishi Viashiria (2)","sourceLessons":2,"supportLessons":0,"lessons":2,"outcomes":["Kutambua matumizi ya viwakilishi viashiria katika sentensi zinazohusiana na mahusiano.","Kutunga sentensi sahihi kwa kuzingatia kanuni za viwakilishi viashiria na upatanisho wa kisarufi.","Kurekebisha makosa ya matumizi ya viwakilishi viashiria na kueleza sababu ya marekebisho."],"inquiry":["Je, viwakilishi viashiria husa